# Verification selection

After each product or test edit, run the smallest StoryOS-owned command that can fail on that edit: one crate test, one HTTP or process-cut file, or one ignored adapter test.

`make verify-local` is the pre-merge evidence command. Start it only after Standards and Spec review on the candidate tree, and only once for that tree. A later commit on the range invalidates that run.

GitHub `verify` is the cheap sentinel after each push. After merge, when `main` has the same tree as the evidence comment, run `make verify-tracker` only.

A red targeted check is fixed with another targeted check.
